{
  "page": 529,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 4853,
      "text": "pandangan mereka tertunduk, ketika mereka keluar dari kuburan, seakan-akan mereka belalang yang beterbangan,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4854,
      "text": "dengan patuh mereka segera datang kepada penyeru itu. Orang-orang kafir berkata, \"Ini adalah hari yang sulit.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4855,
      "text": "Sebelum mereka, kaum Nuh juga telah mendustakan (rasul), maka mereka mendustakan hamba Kami (Nuh) dan mengatakan, \"Dia orang gila!\" Lalu diusirnya dengan ancaman.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4856,
      "text": "Maka dia (Nuh) mengadu kepada Tuhannya, \"Sesungguhnya aku telah dikalahkan, maka tolonglah (aku).\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4857,
      "text": "Lalu Kami bukakan pintu-pintu langit dengan (menurunkan) air yang tercurah,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4858,
      "text": "dan Kami jadikan bumi menyemburkan mata-mata air maka bertemulah (air-air) itu sehinggga (meluap menimbulkan) keadaaan (bencana) yang telah ditetapkan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4859,
      "text": "Dan Kami angkut dia (Nuh) ke atas (kapal) yang terbuat dari papan dan pasak,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4860,
      "text": "yang berlayar dengan pemeliharaan (pengawasan) Kami sebagai balasan bagi orang yang telah diingkari (kaumnya).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4861,
      "text": "Dan sungguh, kapal itu telah Kami jadikan sebagai tanda (pelajaran). Maka adakah orang yang mau mengambil pelajaran?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4862,
      "text": "Maka betapa dahsyatnya azab-Ku dan peringatan-Ku!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4863,
      "text": "Dan sungguh, telah Kami mudahkan Al-Qur`an untuk peringatan, maka adakah orang yang mau mengambil pelajaran?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4864,
      "text": "Kaum 'Ād pun telah mendustakan. Maka betapa dahsyatnya azab-Ku dan peringatan-Ku!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4865,
      "text": "Sesungguhnya Kami telah menghembuskan angin yang sangat kencang kepada mereka pada hari nahas yang terus menerus,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4866,
      "text": "yang membuat manusia bergelimpangan, mereka bagaikan pohon-pohon kurma yang tumbang dengan akar-akarnya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4867,
      "text": "Maka betapa dahsyatnya azab-Ku dan peringatan-Ku!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4868,
      "text": "Dan sungguh, telah Kami mudahkan Al-Qur`an untuk peringatan, maka adakah orang yang mau mengambil pelajaran?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4869,
      "text": "Kaum Samud pun telah mendustakan peringatan itu.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4870,
      "text": "Maka mereka berkata, \"Bagaimana kita akan mengikuti seorang manusia (biasa) di antara kita? Sungguh, kalau begitu kita benar-benar telah sesat dan gila.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4871,
      "text": "Apakah wahyu itu diturunkan kepadanya di antara kita? Pastilah dia (Saleh) seorang yang sangat pendusta (dan) sombong.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4872,
      "text": "Kelak mereka akan mengetahui siapa yang sebenarnya sangat pendusta (dan) sombong itu.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4873,
      "text": "Sesungguhnya Kami akan mengirimkan unta betina sebagai cobaan bagi mereka, maka tunggulah mereka dan bersabarlah (Saleh).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 529,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
  "language": "id"
}
